## 2. 启动网页端 Server

在 PowerShell 中执行：

```powershell
cd "D:\codex\PM开发\ic-pm-web"
python server.py
```

如果系统 `python` 不可用，也可以使用 Codex 内置 Python：

```powershell
cd "D:\codex\PM开发\ic-pm-web"
& "C:\Users\guoyanwu\.cache\codex-runtimes\codex-primary-runtime\dependencies\python\python.exe" "server.py"
```

后台启动命令：

```powershell
$python="C:\Users\guoyanwu\.cache\codex-runtimes\codex-primary-runtime\dependencies\python\python.exe"
$work="D:\codex\PM开发\ic-pm-web"
Start-Process -FilePath $python -ArgumentList "server.py" -WorkingDirectory $work -WindowStyle Hidden -RedirectStandardOutput "$work\server.out.log" -RedirectStandardError "$work\server.err.log"
```

检查端口：

```powershell
Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 8899
```

正常时应看到：

```text
0.0.0.0  8899  Listen
```

